        <headline>High Wind Watch issued September 24 at 11:15AM MDT until September 26 at 9:00AM MDT by NWS Great Falls MT</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Westerly winds 30 to 40 mph with gusts up to 60 mph
possible.

* WHERE...Southern High Plains.

* WHEN...From Friday evening through Saturday morning.

* IMPACTS...Travel could be difficult, especially for high profile or
light weight vehicles.
</description>
